# A system-named column made by an extend below the map must also keep the filter above the map.

admin 'create table test::t26 { id: int4, a: int4 }'
---
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
> |   id    |  namespace  |  table  |  created  |
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
> |  16388  |    test     |   t26   |   true    |
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
>

query 'CALL rql::explain("from test::t26 extend {time: 5} map {id} filter {time > 1}")'
---
> +-------+---------+----------+-------------+------------------------+
> |  idx  |  depth  |  parent  |    kind     |         detail         |
> +-------+---------+----------+-------------+------------------------+
> |   0   |    0    |   none   |   Filter    |  (time > Constant(1))  |
> |   1   |    1    |    0     |     Map     |           id           |
> |   2   |    2    |    1     |   Extend    |  Constant(5) as time   |
> |   3   |    3    |    2     |  TableScan  |       test::t26        |
> +-------+---------+----------+-------------+------------------------+
>
